# GC-163-04: LF everywhere — source-checking tests compare code with \n; a Windows checkout with autocrlf=true broke 30+ tests.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
